WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.871
Every good Popkin ends. Here is the send-off.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.032
On the Popkin home, the Host opens Popkin settings, and chooses Wrap up: End it now

00:00:13.032 --> 00:00:14.484
and send the recap.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.244
The wrap-up screen asks: Wrap up Lakeside Weekend? It says what happens next for all

00:00:23.244 --> 00:00:27.290
fourteen of you: everyone gets a recap, and chat goes quiet.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:32.727
Keep the photo album is on. Turn it off, and photos are removed after thirty days.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.695
Choose Wrap it up. The button reads Wrapping up, and the recap opens for everyone

00:00:38.695 --> 00:00:40.386
who has the Popkin open.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.357
This Popkin wrapped up. What a time.

00:00:44.557 --> 00:00:49.659
Fourteen people showed up. One thousand two hundred and eighty-six messages sent,

00:00:49.659 --> 00:00:55.123
forty-eight photos shared, and the top-rated moment: Sunrise canoe to Heron Point.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.475
Save the album prepares a zip of every photo, and shows its progress: Preparing

00:01:00.475 --> 00:01:02.021
twelve of forty-eight.

00:01:02.221 --> 00:01:07.314
If the album was not kept, a notice counts the days: Photos go in twelve days.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.976
The chat stays readable: This Popkin has wrapped up. Messages stay, but nobody can

00:01:12.976 --> 00:01:14.125
post new ones.

00:01:14.325 --> 00:01:18.544
Photos and Experiences stay readable too, and nothing can be added.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.216
A Popkin with an end date warns in its last hour: One hour left.

00:01:26.416 --> 00:01:29.746
Every member sees the banner. The Host's offers Change.

00:01:29.946 --> 00:01:34.266
When the time comes, it wraps up by itself, with its photo album kept.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:40.433
From the recap, the Host can Pop up another with this crew. A member can Start your

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:41.321
own Popkin.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.408
On a phone, the recap is one column.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.785
From ten twenty-four pixels, its pictures sit beside its numbers and actions.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:57.180
And from seven sixty-eight, the wrap-up screen shows the recap it will make.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.963
What no screen shows: once a Popkin has wrapped up, every request to add to it is

00:02:02.963 --> 00:02:05.898
refused, and only the Host can wrap one up.

00:02:06.098 --> 00:02:08.629
Still to come: Change how long it lasts.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.497
That is journey nine. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
